[18.820327, "o", "## Decisions in force (1)\r\n\r\nEach was accepted, and none of them superseded. For the argument behind one, ask\r\n`read_record` for its id.\r\nEach line ends with the day it was accepted and whether an agent accepted it or no agent was \r\ndeclared.\r\nThe identity is mnid:69ed725f, unless a line names another.\r\n0 of them were accepted by an agent and 1 with no agent declared.\r\n\r\nNo other decision recorded here is awaiting a judgement."]
[18.820393, "o", "\r\n\r\n- **ADR-1: Keep money as integer cents** · `01a201c0-6236-7000-83a1-391079a48c7e` · \r\n2026-11-22 · no agent declared\r\n"]
